<div class="snp">
  <div class="snp__head">
    <p class="snp__eyebrow">Terms and policies</p>
    <h2 class="snp__title">Shipping and delivery</h2>
    <p class="snp__lead">Free delivery on every order, tracking on every parcel – and a delivery time you can count on.</p>
    <p class="snp__date">Last updated October 7, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__facts">
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">Free</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">shipping, no minimum order</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">3–4</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">business days to dispatch</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">3–6</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">business days in transit</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">Tracking</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">on every parcel</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">01</span>Shipping costs</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Delivery is free on every order – whatever the amount. We cover any import duties and fees, so nothing extra is charged at checkout or on delivery. Applicable sales taxes are shown at checkout.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">02</span>Where do we deliver?</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>We deliver across Canada – to every province and territory, to homes, businesses and pickup points. Deliveries to remote and northern areas may take a few days longer.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">03</span>Delivery time</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <div class="snp__table">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Step</th><th>Time</th><th>What happens</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Processing</td><td>3–4 business days</td><td>We confirm, pack and ship your order</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Transit</td><td>3–6 business days</td><td>Your parcel is on its way and you can track it</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Total</td><td>6–10 business days</td><td>From order to delivery</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p>Business days are Monday to Friday. If you order at the weekend or on a public holiday, we start on your order the next business day. In busy periods such as Black Friday and December, delivery may take a few days longer.</p>
      <p>We don't offer express delivery, so we can't promise delivery on a specific date. If you have a deadline, allow 6–10 business days.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">04</span>Carriers</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>We use established carriers – including Canada Post, UPS, FedEx and DHL – depending on where the parcel ships from. Your parcel is delivered to your address or to a nearby pickup point, according to the carrier's standard rules.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">05</span>Several parcels</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Our items ship directly from our makers' warehouses, so an order with several items may arrive in several parcels, each with its own tracking number. This costs nothing extra – you just get more than one delivery.</p>
      <p>If the last parcel hasn't arrived a week after the first, write to us.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">06</span>Tracking</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>You'll get a tracking number by email as soon as your parcel ships – while we're packing your order, it doesn't exist yet. You can follow your parcel on our <a href="/pages/track-order">Track your order</a> page.</p>
      <p>Can't find the email? Check your spam folder. Tracking can go quiet for a few days while the parcel moves between carriers – that alone doesn't mean it's lost.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">07</span>Changing the delivery address</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>If you entered a wrong address, send us the correct one with your order number right away. We'll update it as long as the order hasn't shipped. Once the parcel is with the carrier, the address can't be changed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">08</span>Late, damaged or lost parcels</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Late:</strong> if tracking hasn't updated for 7 days, or the expected date has passed, write to us with your order number and we'll chase it up.</li>
        <li><strong>Marked as delivered but not received:</strong> ask the people you live with and your neighbours, and check your mailbox and the nearest pickup point. If it still hasn't turned up, write to us within 7 days of the delivery scan so we can raise it with the carrier in time.</li>
        <li><strong>Damaged parcel or item:</strong> take photos of the parcel and the item, and write to us as soon as possible.</li>
        <li><strong>Lost:</strong> if the carrier loses your parcel, we send a new item or refund your money.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">09</span>Returns</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>You have 30 days to return an item. Read how to send something back in our <a href="/pages/retur-og-refusionspolitik">returns and refunds policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__help">
    <p class="snp__help-title">Where's my parcel?</p>
    <p>Follow it with your tracking number – or write to us and we'll chase it up.</p>
    <a class="snp__btn" href="/pages/track-order">Track your order</a>
    <p class="snp__help-meta">support@daltonpierce.com · Mon–Fri 9:00–18:00 CET · reply within 1–2 business days</p>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__more">
    <p class="snp__more-title">Terms and policies</p>
    <div class="snp__more-links">
      <a href="/pages/vilkar-og-betingelser">Terms of service</a>
      <a href="/pages/retur-og-refusionspolitik">Returns and refunds</a>
      <a class="snp__cur" href="/pages/forsendelsespolitik">Shipping and delivery</a>
      <a href="/pages/payment-policy">Payment</a>
      <a href="/pages/betalingspolitik">Privacy policy</a>
      <a href="/pages/contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
